        },
        {
          "text": " Keyakikis Sanabalat ka Gesem eoŋ kobalas ebe, “Kobia, keriamunos ediopet koreria luka apuuton naka Ono.” Konye keomito aiswamakin eoŋ aronis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
