        },
        {
          "text": " ewadikatai kotomake cbe, “Elimorokinitai toma atekerin, abu da Gasimu kolim ebe, kwape iwomitotor ijo ka Iyudayan aipaliikin; ŋes kiinakini iduki arwatat: ikoto araun ekabakakee, kwape ejaatar akiro ŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibwaiki da inabin luelimonokinete nukon ko Yerusalem, kineras atiar, ‘Ejai ekabaka toma Yuda’: kwana da itejenunio ekabaka kwape ejaatar akiro ŋun. Aso do, kobia, kenerut.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
