            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naarai akotosi kesi kere aitukurian sio ebe, “Kokalanyakata akaninikee, kinyek aswam aiswamaunio.” Konye kwana, wu Edeke, kitogogon ijo akakanin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.9",
